#
# File: 210-ARP-Proxy-reply-in-monitor.rule
# Policy: Monitor ARP replies claiming addresses in the zone subnet
# Description:
#     Runs after ARP hook and zone interface map/vmap dispatch; no interface matching here.
#     A reply advertising a subnet address is not proof of proxy ARP; ownership requires external IP/MAC bindings.
#     Direction: remote-to-local; intended for arp input hook.
#
arp operation reply arp saddr ip $ZONE_INTF_NETADDR_W_PREFIX counter comment "remote-to-local Proxy reply monitor"
